{"meta":{"id":"qr-code","category":"it/tools/api","title":"QR 코드 생성","subtitle":"","summary":"링크 주소로 QR 코드 생성","tags":["qr","qrcode","react"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"blog: etc/QrCodeCreate.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-06-06"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>TOOL</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-06-06</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">QR 코드 생성</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 링크 주소로 QR 코드 생성</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">설치</p>\r\n<div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">npm install qrcode.react</pre></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">QR 코드 생성 (qrcode.react)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsx</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import { QRCodeCanvas } from &#x27;qrcode.react&#x27;;\r\n\r\n&lt;QRCodeCanvas\r\n  value={qrValue}\r\n  size={128}             // 픽셀 크기\r\n  bgColor=&quot;#ffffff&quot;      // 배경 색상\r\n  fgColor=&quot;#000000&quot;      // 전경(코드) 색상\r\n  level=&quot;H&quot;              // 오류 보정 수준 (L, M, Q, H)\r\n  includeMargin={true}   // 바깥 여백 추가\r\n/&gt;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">링크 주소를 입력하고 생성하면 QRCodeCanvas가 캔버스에 QR 코드를 그립니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">QR 코드를 텍스트로 변환</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// QR 캔버스를 텍스트(■/□)로 변환\r\nconst qrToString = () =&gt; {\r\n  const canvas = document.querySelector(&#x27;canvas&#x27;);\r\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(&#x27;2d&#x27;);\r\n  const { width, height } = canvas;\r\n  const pixels = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, width, height).data; // 1픽셀당 RGBA 4바이트\r\n  const threshold = 128;\r\n  let result = &#x27;&#x27;;\r\n  for (let y = 0; y &lt; height; y++) {\r\n    let row = &#x27;&#x27;;\r\n    for (let x = 0; x &lt; width; x++) {\r\n      const index = (y * width + x) * 4;\r\n      const gray = (pixels[index] + pixels[index + 1] + pixels[index + 2]) / 3; // 흑백 판별 (단순 평균)\r\n      row += gray &lt; threshold ? &#x27;■&#x27; : &#x27;□&#x27;;\r\n    }\r\n    result += row + &#x27;\\n&#x27;;\r\n  }\r\n  return result;\r\n};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">캔버스 픽셀의 밝기로 흑/백을 판별해 ■/□ 문자로 바꿉니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/api/qr-code","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"api","title":"API · 라이브러리 활용","path":"it/tools/api"}],"hasImage":false}